Package: pve-triton-qemu
Architecture: amd64
# libegl1/libepoxy0/libgbm1/libgl1/libopengl0 are dlopen()ed at runtime
# by epoxy (display GL init), invisible to dh_shlibdeps — keep explicit.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, pve-triton-virglrenderer,
 libegl1, libepoxy0, libgbm1, libgl1, libopengl0
Description: QEMU fork with Neptune-capable virtio-gpu (Triton stack)
 Fork of utmapp/qemu (dev/neptune-linux branch, base QEMU 10.0.12) built
 for x86_64-softmmu with VirGL 1.3 + epoxy. Exposes the
 virtio-gpu-gl-pci device properties blob, hostmem, venus and neptune
 required for Triton D3D11 acceleration in Windows guests. Installed
 under /usr/lib/pve-triton/qemu; launches via /usr/bin/pve-triton-qemu
 (pve-triton-stack). Coexists with pve-qemu-kvm.
 Upstream: https://github.com/utmapp/qemu
